

Fandaharana diovy.


>> Veggy := Zavatra vaovao.
Veggy rehefa: ['vaovao'] ataovy: {
	>> v := tena vaovao.
	v init. <- v.
}.

Veggy rehefa: ['init'] ataovy: { azy veggies := 0. }.

Veggy rehefa: ['carrots:'] ataovy: { :a azy veggies := a. <- Tsinontsinona. }.
Veggy rehefa: ['carrots'] ataovy: { <- azy veggies. }.
Veggy rehefa: ['+'] ataovy: { :f
	>> n := Veggy vaovao.
	n carrots: (f carrots + azy veggies). <- n.
}.

Veggy rehefa: ['soratra'] ataovy: { <- azy veggies soratra.
}.

Isa rehefa: ['carrots'] ataovy: {
	>> x := Veggy vaovao.
	x carrots: tena. <- x.
}.

Isa rehefa: ['add:and:'] ataovy: { :a :b <- (a + b).
}.

>> q := 0 add: (3 carrots + 2 carrots) and: 4 carrots.
Vokatra soraty: q, andalana-vaovao.
